# Published vs in this repo

**Published** means a visitor can open the page on https://rtikhonov.com.

After Workers Builds is connected, a merge to `main` publishes because
Cloudflare deploys the Worker. GitHub does not host the site.

These are **not** published:

- A commit or PR that is not on `main`
- A green GitHub check
- GitHub Pages (do not use it)

Never deploy with GitHub Pages or GitHub Actions. Ship only on Cloudflare
Workers. GitHub is version control only.

Inspiration stays gated by `INSPIRATION_ENABLED`. Check the live URL; do not
assume `/inspiration/` is public.

When asked about unpublished / live / public changes, check the live URL first.
Then report git status as "in this repo" only if the URL does not show it.
